    {
      "text": "斩击、猛击与踢击连成高速肢解终结技",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Chain slashes, bashes, and kicks into devastating finishers as limbs fly and blood paints the walls. Combat thrives on momentum: move fast, hit hard, and never give your enemies a chance to breathe.",
